<div style="text-align:center;padding:1rem;border-radius:12px;background:#0e2417;color:#eafff2;margin:1rem 0;">
  <p style="font-size:1.6rem;margin:.2rem 0;"><strong>21+</strong></p>
  <p style="margin:.2rem 0;">Adults only. CannaDash serves licensed cannabis retailers and their adult customers, in states and markets where cannabis delivery is legal — and nowhere else.</p>
